---
description: >-
  Same dual central-connection circles on the "normal" arrow family (solid,
  dotted, open, cross, close) as the "-ltr" sibling, but with Bob/Charlie as
  the senders so messages flow right-to-left.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Bob()->>()Alice: Circles at both ends with solid arrow (RTL)
  Charlie()-->>()Bob: Circles at both ends with dotted arrow (RTL)
  Bob()->()Alice: Circles at both ends with open arrow (RTL)
  Charlie()--x()Alice: Circles at both ends with cross arrow (RTL)
  Bob()--)()Alice: Circles at both ends with close arrow (RTL)
